    id: 10018,
    title: "NFL Power Rankings: Where Every Team Stands Before Kickoff",
    slug: "nfl-power-rankings-every-team-stands-before-kickoff",
    excerpt: "Preseason power rankings are finally locked. Here's where every NFL team stands before the 2026 season kicks off.",
    content: "The preseason is over and the power rankings are locked. For the next eighteen weeks they will move every Tuesday, but these are the pegs every team will be judged against: the elite tier built around established quarterback play and deep rosters; the contender cluster where one injury could swing the division standings; and the rebuild tier hunting for next year's draft pick. Injury reports will reshuffle these rankings weekly, the waiver wire will reward managers who watch depth charts, and the Super Bowl odds at the top will tighten after kickoff. Every power ranking debate comes down to one question: can the roster on paper survive contact? Rankings never played a down, but they set the table for the greatest regular season in football.",
