    id: 10019,
    title: "Super Bowl Odds 2027: Early Favorites and Value Bets",
    slug: "super-bowl-odds-2027-early-favorites-value-bets",
    excerpt: "The 2027 Super Bowl odds are out before the 2026 season even kicks off. Here are the early favorites and the best value bets.",
    content: "Bookmakers released their first 2027 Super Bowl odds months ago, and the board has already moved with training camp news. The favorites are no surprise — the teams with elite quarterback play and balanced rosters sit atop the market. But odds in September are about value, not certainty. History says the eventual champion rarely opens the season as the top seed in the betting market. The smart angles in early odds are the teams with healthy depth charts, soft division standings and injury reports that heal quickly. Free agency winners who added starters late, rookie quarterbacks who exceeded preseason expectations, and veteran defenses that stayed healthy all make the best value cases. Super Bowl odds will tighten after Week 1, so the sharpest bets are often placed before the first kickoff. Just remember: the season is a marathon, and September favorites are rarely February champions.",
